1
00:00:48,900 --> 00:00:52,900
(If you don't want to get reported,
come running quickly.)

2
00:01:33,600 --> 00:01:37,000
"Proxy Driver"

3
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:41,400
(Episode 2)

4
00:02:15,927 --> 00:02:17,262
Please, come in.

5
00:02:46,958 --> 00:02:51,045
Actually, I asked to see you
because I wanted to apologize.

6
00:02:52,714 --> 00:03:03,808
What?
Please, have a seat first.

7
00:03:05,810 --> 00:03:07,979
That day, I found out...

8
00:03:07,979 --> 00:03:10,815
my wife was having an affair.

9
00:03:10,815 --> 00:03:11,858
I was so drunk.

10
00:03:11,858 --> 00:03:14,277
I wasn't in my right mind.

11
00:03:14,277 --> 00:03:17,280
Oh, thank god.

12
00:03:17,614 --> 00:03:20,408
I thought you were some creep.

13
00:03:20,408 --> 00:03:23,411
I'm not that kind of person.

14
00:03:24,454 --> 00:03:28,583
It was actually my wife's birthday.

15
00:03:28,583 --> 00:03:31,586
I'd even planned a surprise...

16
00:03:33,129 --> 00:03:36,132
But suddenly being all alone,

17
00:03:36,257 --> 00:03:39,260
it was so scary and lonely.

18
00:03:42,138 --> 00:03:45,099
I had no one to call.

19
00:03:45,099 --> 00:03:48,102
You were the only one

20
00:03:48,144 --> 00:03:51,105
I could think of.

21
00:03:52,440 --> 00:03:55,610
But you really scared me back there.

22
00:03:55,652 --> 00:03:58,196
You scared me to death.

23
00:03:58,196 --> 00:04:00,323
I'm sorry.

24
00:04:00,323 --> 00:04:03,326
To make it up to you,

25
00:04:03,534 --> 00:04:05,453
Let me pour you a drink.

26
00:04:05,453 --> 00:04:07,163
No, it's okay.

27
00:04:07,163 --> 00:04:10,124
I should probably go now.

28
00:04:10,875 --> 00:04:15,672
Please, stay just a moment.

29
00:04:18,299 --> 00:04:21,302
I don't know what I might do.

30
00:04:27,225 --> 00:04:29,185
Alright, then.

31
00:04:29,185 --> 00:04:32,188
I'll stay for a little while.

32
00:05:08,224 --> 00:05:09,726
We met three years ago.

33
00:05:14,480 --> 00:05:17,483
No matter how much I messed up,

34
00:05:17,525 --> 00:05:20,528
she always said she loved me.

35
00:05:21,237 --> 00:05:24,365
But yesterday...

36
00:05:26,701 --> 00:05:29,704
I went to her church,

37
00:05:30,121 --> 00:05:33,124
and saw her in bed with the pastor.

38
00:05:37,462 --> 00:05:40,465
I loved that bitch so much.

39
00:05:40,840 --> 00:05:42,258
I really, truly loved her.

40
00:05:44,093 --> 00:05:46,846
I loved her so much, that bitch!

41
00:05:48,890 --> 00:05:50,391
How could she do this to me?

42
00:05:51,225 --> 00:05:52,143
To me

43
00:05:58,191 --> 00:05:59,484
What do I...

44
00:06:00,526 --> 00:06:01,778
What do I do?

45
00:06:07,492 --> 00:06:08,701
Please, help me.

46
00:12:10,730 --> 00:12:12,690
It's my first time. I have to go.

47
00:12:13,190 --> 00:12:15,317
So what, you bitch?

48
00:12:15,735 --> 00:12:16,485
So what?
